     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font:11pt/normal Calibri,sans-serif;color:rgb(34,34,34);text-transform:none;text-indent:0px;letter-spacing:normal;word-spacing:0px;white-space:normal;font-size-adjust:none;font-stretch:normal;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><p style=\"margin:0px\" class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Dear all,<br><br>I just announced<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">on the Phidot website<span> </span></span></span></span>two introductory hierarchical modeling workshops in early 2014: see<span> </span><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f=8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f%3D8&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495349494000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1sbXkepUKE0e3rbJpKO0Ka\"><u>www.phidot.org/forum/viewforum.php?f=8</u></a><br><br>(1)<span> </span><b><span style=\"color:blue\">Introduction to Bayesian analysis of wildlife populations using BUGS software</span></b>(taught by Marc Kéry),<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span style=\"border-bottom-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:dashed\"><span>17–21 February 2014</span></span>,<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" href=\"http://www.hspj.com.my/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.hspj.com.my/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495349494000&amp;usg=AOvVaw21LEpijV2OzucEchnmD63X\"><span style=\"color:windowtext;text-decoration:none\"><u>Singgahsana Hotel</u></span></a></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">, Petaling Jaya, Kuala Lumpur, Malaysia; see<span> </span><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=2584&amp;sid=5ef6d800a29829a0e9e164243729f2b9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f%3D8%26t%3D2584%26sid%3D5ef6d800a29829a0e9e164243729f2b9&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495349494000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0qQWiRPkptk_7m2zwuBTcB\"><u>www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=2584&amp;sid=5ef6d800a29829a0e9e164243729f2b9</u></a><span> </span><span> </span>or<span> </span><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" href=\"http://www.bcss.org.my/stats/BAWP_outline.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.bcss.org.my/stats/BAWP_outline.htm&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792495349494000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0QMZTOcANEkj1U4uua1fKL\"><u>www.bcss.org.my/stats/BAWP_outline.htm</u></a>.<span> </span><br><br>(2)<span> </span></span><b><span style=\"color:blue;font-size:11pt\">Hierarchical Bayesian Modeling for Ecologists</span></b><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\"><span> </span>(taught by Marc Kéry &amp;<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Gonçalo Ferraz</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">),<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"border-bottom-color:rgb(204,204,204);border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:dashed\"><span>24–28 March 2014</span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">,<span> </span></span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\">Universidade Federal do Rio Grande do Sul, Porto Alegre, Brasil</span><span style=\"font-size:11pt\" lang=\"EN-GB\">; see<span> </span><a style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" href=\"http://www.phidot.org/forum/viewtopic.php?f=8&amp;t=2585&amp;p=8189#p8189\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-sa